       01  DFHRESP-NORMAL         PIC S9(08) COMP VALUE 0.
       01  DFHRESP-NOTFND         PIC S9(08) COMP VALUE 13.
       01  DFHRESP-DUPREC         PIC S9(08) COMP VALUE 14.
       01  DFHRESP-LENGERR        PIC S9(08) COMP VALUE 22.
       01  DFHRESP-ENDFILE        PIC S9(08) COMP VALUE 20.
       01  DFHRESP-ENQBUSY        PIC S9(08) COMP VALUE 55.
